      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Dry Ridge''' is a city located in [[Grant County, Kentucky]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,995.

== Geography ==
[[Image:KYMap-doton-DryRidge.PNG|right|Location of Dry Ridge, Kentucky]]
Dry Ridge is located at 38&amp;deg;40'56&quot; North, 84&amp;deg;35'47&quot; West (38.682242, -84.596370){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 12.1 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (4.7 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  12.1 km&amp;sup2; (4.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and 0.1 km&amp;sup2; (0.04 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is water.  The total area is 0.43% water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,995 people, 771 households, and 535 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 165.3/km&amp;sup2; (428.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 861 housing units at an average density of 71.3/km&amp;sup2; (184.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 97.19% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.55% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.10% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 1.30% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.20% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.65% from two or more races.  0.70% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 771 households out of which 39.7% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 46.4% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 18.2% have a female householder with no husband present, and 30.5% are non-families. 26.6% of all households are made up of individuals and 12.1% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.51 and the average family size is 3.00.

In the city the population is spread out with 28.6% under the age of 18, 11.1% from 18 to 24, 29.3% from 25 to 44, 18.9% from 45 to 64, and 12.1% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 31 years.  For every 100 females there are 87.3 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 83.0 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $30,647, and the median income for a family is $32,202. Males have a median income of $38,000 versus $23,000 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $14,568.  23.5% of the population and 21.0% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 39.0% of those under the age of 18 and 14.4% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

