As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 316 people, 141 households, and 90 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 196.8/km&amp;sup2; (508.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 166 housing units at an average density of 103.4/km&amp;sup2; (266.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 94.94% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 4.75% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.00% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.00% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.32% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.00% from two or more races.  0.32% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

