In the city the population is spread out with 24.1% under the age of 18, 7.6% from 18 to 24, 26.3% from 25 to 44, 23.7% from 45 to 64, and 18.4% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 40 years.  For every 100 females there are 89.2 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 83.2 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $26,071, and the median income for a family is $33,750. Males have a median income of $27,361 versus $17,500 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $14,387.  21.1% of the population and 17.5% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 37.2% of those under the age of 18 and 14.3% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

