'''Greensburg''' is a city located in [[Green County, Kentucky]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 2,396.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Green County, Kentucky|Green County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
Greensburg is located at 37&amp;deg;15'35&quot; North, 85&amp;deg;29'52&quot; West (37.259665, -85.497863){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 4.9 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.9 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  4.9 km&amp;sup2; (1.9 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 2,396 people, 1,061 households, and 648 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 484.3/km&amp;sup2; (1,255.4/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 1,190 housing units at an average density of 240.6/km&amp;sup2; (623.5/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 92.99% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 4.63% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.08% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.38% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.50% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.42% from two or more races.  0.96% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 1,061 households out of which 24.8% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 43.6% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 14.1% have a female householder with no husband present, and 38.9% are non-families. 37.1% of all households are made up of individuals and 21.3% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.12 and the average family size is 2.75.

In the city the population is spread out with 21.5% under the age of 18, 7.7% from 18 to 24, 22.1% from 25 to 44, 23.4% from 45 to 64, and 25.3% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 44 years.  For every 100 females there are 78.5 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 71.5 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $20,556, and the median income for a family is $29,818. Males have a median income of $26,065 versus $18,031 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $14,296.  24.8% of the population and 21.3% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 34.8% of those under the age of 18 and 13.5% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

== External links ==
