      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Lewisport''' is a city located in [[Hancock County, Kentucky]], along the [[Ohio River]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,639.

== Geography ==
[[Image:KYMap-doton-Lewisport.PNG|right|Location of Lewisport, Kentucky]]
Lewisport is located at 37&amp;deg;56'6&quot; North, 86&amp;deg;54'19&quot; West (37.935023, -86.905270){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 2.7 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (1.1 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  2.7 km&amp;sup2; (1.1 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,639 people, 648 households, and 452 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 597.0/km&amp;sup2; (1,540.8/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 748 housing units at an average density of 272.5/km&amp;sup2; (703.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 96.40% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 1.89% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.37% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.61% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.24% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.49% from two or more races.  1.65% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 648 households out of which 35.2% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 53.4% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 12.5% have a female householder with no husband present, and 30.2% are non-families. 27.6% of all households are made up of individuals and 11.4% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.43 and the average family size is 2.98.

In the city the population is spread out with 25.8% under the age of 18, 10.2% from 18 to 24, 27.4% from 25 to 44, 21.2% from 45 to 64, and 15.4% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 35 years.  For every 100 females there are 88.2 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 84.5 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $35,774, and the median income for a family is $42,321. Males have a median income of $39,318 versus $21,705 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $16,413.  17.0% of the population and 15.6% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 24.7% of those under the age of 18 and 16.6% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

