      <text xml:space="preserve">'''West Point''' is a city located in [[Hardin County, Kentucky]] (near the edge of [[Fort Knox]] military reservation on [[Dixie Highway]]). It is located in a former meander bend of the [[Ohio River]]. As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,100.

== Geography ==
[[Image:KYMap-doton-WestPoint.PNG|right|Location of West Point, Kentucky]]
West Point is located at 37&amp;deg;59'30&quot; North, 85&amp;deg;57'16&quot; West (37.991543, -85.954540){{GR|1}}, at the confluence of the [[Ohio River|Ohio]] and [[Salt River (Kentucky)|Salt]] Rivers.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 7.0 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (2.7 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  7.0 km&amp;sup2; (2.7 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,100 people, 439 households, and 281 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 157.9/km&amp;sup2; (408.5/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 566 housing units at an average density of 81.2/km&amp;sup2; (210.2/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 98.09% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 0.64% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.64% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.09% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.09% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 0.45% from two or more races.  0.82% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 439 households out of which 31.4% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 43.7% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 14.8% have a female householder with no husband present, and 35.8% are non-families. 29.8% of all households are made up of individuals and 11.6% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.51 and the average family size is 3.09.

In the city the population is spread out with 26.2% under the age of 18, 10.6% from 18 to 24, 30.0% from 25 to 44, 20.6% from 45 to 64, and 12.5% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 34 years.  For every 100 females there are 101.1 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 97.1 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $29,792, and the median income for a family is $35,139. Males have a median income of $23,611 versus $18,125 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $13,381.  20.3% of the population and 15.9% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 29.3% of those under the age of 18 and 15.1% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

