      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Evarts''' is a city located in [[Harlan County, Kentucky]].  The post office was opened on Feburary 9, 1855 and named for one of the area's pioneer families. As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 1,101.

== Geography ==
[[Image:KYMap-doton-Evarts.PNG|right|Location of Evarts, Kentucky]]
Evarts is located at 36&amp;deg;51'50&quot; North, 83&amp;deg;11'39&quot; West (36.863842, -83.194269){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 1.6 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.6 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  1.6 km&amp;sup2; (0.6 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.

== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 1,101 people, 428 households, and 299 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 708.5/km&amp;sup2; (1,828.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 490 housing units at an average density of 315.3/km&amp;sup2; (813.6/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 94.91% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 2.82% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.09% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.09% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.00% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.45% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.63% from two or more races.  0.64% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

There are 428 households out of which 31.1% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 50.7% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 15.9% have a female householder with no husband present, and 30.1% are non-families. 26.9% of all households are made up of individuals and 13.6% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.57 and the average family size is 3.13.

In the city the population is spread out with 28.4% under the age of 18, 7.8% from 18 to 24, 26.4% from 25 to 44, 23.7% from 45 to 64, and 13.6% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 36 years.  For every 100 females there are 92.1 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 85.0 males.

The median income for a household in the city is $17,963, and the median income for a family is $22,159. Males have a median income of $26,125 versus $18,125 for females. The [[per capita income]] for the city is $12,657.  37.3% of the population and 31.3% of families are below the [[poverty line]].  Out of the total population, 52.7% of those under the age of 18 and 23.1% of those 65 and older are living below the poverty line.

