      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Corydon''' is a city located in [[Henderson County, Kentucky]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 744.

== Geography ==
[[Image:KYMap-doton-Corydon.PNG|right|Location of Corydon, Kentucky]]
