      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Coldstream''' is a city located in [[Jefferson County, Kentucky]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the city had a total population of 956.

== Geography ==
Coldstream is located at 38&amp;deg;19'1&quot; North, 85&amp;deg;31'44&quot; West (38.317031, -85.528809){{GR|1}}.

According to the [[United States Census Bureau]], the city has a total area of 0.6 [[square kilometer|km&amp;sup2;]] (0.2 [[square mile|mi&amp;sup2;]]).  0.6 km&amp;sup2; (0.2 mi&amp;sup2;) of it is land and none of it is covered by water.